1
00:00:15,427 --> 00:00:17,207
HA JUNG-WOO

2
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:19,427
IM SOO-JUNG

3
00:00:22,893 --> 00:00:25,017
KIM JUN-HAN

4
00:00:25,611 --> 00:00:27,191
KRYSTAL JUNG

5
00:00:33,839 --> 00:00:35,522
SHIM EUN-KYUNG

6
00:00:55,205 --> 00:00:59,038
MAD CONCRETE DREAMS

7
00:01:13,771 --> 00:01:14,604
Please help me.

8
00:01:14,605 --> 00:01:16,230
Please help me, okay?

9
00:01:16,231 --> 00:01:17,431
Just help me.

10
00:01:18,238 --> 00:01:20,605
Yes, please give that.

11
00:01:22,271 --> 00:01:24,970
COMMERCIAL LEASE AGREEMENT

12
00:01:24,971 --> 00:01:26,137
Mr. Jung Chang-su,

13
00:01:26,138 --> 00:01:27,570
I wish you had done this sooner.

14
00:01:27,571 --> 00:01:29,537
I'm sorry. Yes, I'm sorry.

15
00:01:29,538 --> 00:01:31,371
- Why are you so fearless?
- Yes.

16
00:01:32,131 --> 00:01:33,431
I'm sorry.

17
00:01:36,417 --> 00:01:39,017
- Hello.
- Yes, hello.

18
00:01:41,891 --> 00:01:42,691
Knife.

19
00:01:47,138 --> 00:01:47,770
Oh,

20
00:01:47,771 --> 00:01:49,304
why are you doing this?

21
00:01:49,305 --> 00:01:50,910
I did what you asked.

22
00:01:51,457 --> 00:01:53,457
What did I do? Why are you so startled?

23
00:01:54,205 --> 00:01:55,838
Huh? Oh...

24
00:01:57,131 --> 00:01:58,631
Are you going to call the police?

25
00:01:59,387 --> 00:02:01,654
Oh, of course not! I would never do that.

26
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:03,779
I did this completely willingly.

27
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:04,819
On my own.

28
00:02:04,820 --> 00:02:06,753
How was I supposed to know?

29
00:02:06,754 --> 00:02:08,520
I saw you sold the building
for a pittance.

30
00:02:09,054 --> 00:02:10,486
Were you threatened?

31
00:02:10,487 --> 00:02:11,286
No.

32
00:02:11,287 --> 00:02:12,319
I wasn't threatened.

33
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,587
I did it because I needed quick cash.

34
00:02:17,799 --> 00:02:18,799
That's a lie.

35
00:02:19,087 --> 00:02:20,619
Why are you doing this?

36
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:21,753
Please!

37
00:02:21,754 --> 00:02:24,019
I already signed the document!

38
00:02:24,020 --> 00:02:26,586
Please let me go!
I'll give you everything!

39
00:02:26,587 --> 00:02:28,354
I'll give you everything I have!

40
00:02:29,854 --> 00:02:30,520
Huh?

41
00:02:31,987 --> 00:02:32,887
Oh,

42
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:36,186
thank you.

43
00:02:36,187 --> 00:02:37,254
Thank you.

44
00:02:38,454 --> 00:02:40,586
Thank you.

45
00:02:40,587 --> 00:02:41,886
Be careful.

46
00:02:41,887 --> 00:02:43,713
There are a lot of eyes outside,
so just wait a bit before you go out.

47
00:02:43,714 --> 00:02:45,147
Yes, I'll do that.

48
00:02:45,487 --> 00:02:46,887
- Sit down.
- Oh, yes.

49
00:02:47,587 --> 00:02:48,520
Thank you.

50
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,754
Have a nice day.

51
00:02:56,387 --> 00:02:57,487
It's a snail.

52
00:02:58,820 --> 00:03:00,120
Why is it here?

53
00:03:01,833 --> 00:03:03,967
Since it's dangerous here,
shall we go out together?

54
00:03:14,654 --> 00:03:16,286
Yes, take care.

55
00:03:16,287 --> 00:03:17,854
Thank you.

56
00:03:36,254 --> 00:03:37,187
What are you doing?

57
00:03:39,020 --> 00:03:40,687
It's dangerous to stay inside.

58
00:03:43,287 --> 00:03:44,086
It's pretty cute.

59
00:03:44,087 --> 00:03:45,487
The cheers are starting!

60
00:03:49,254 --> 00:03:52,020
Let's give a warm welcome
to our honored guests.

61
00:03:56,987 --> 00:03:58,187
Is anyone out there?

62
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:00,887
This is a historic moment
for the future.

63
00:04:00,888 --> 00:04:03,020
Please give a big round of applause!

64
00:04:03,654 --> 00:04:05,587
First step in the redevelopment
of Sejeong-ro Zone 4

65
00:04:08,487 --> 00:04:09,354
It's been taken care of.

66
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:11,554
Good job.

67
00:04:13,032 --> 00:04:15,266
From now on, handle everything quickly
without hesitation.

68
00:04:15,820 --> 00:04:19,287
But make sure
our company's existence remains hidden.

69
00:04:20,854 --> 00:04:23,920
Deputy Nam,
we are ready to proceed.

70
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,720
Everything is ready.

71
00:04:27,401 --> 00:04:29,201
And this is
Jonah Kim from our team.

72
00:04:29,527 --> 00:04:32,060
If you need anything,
she will take care of it.

73
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,853
This is Jonah Kim
from the local side.

74
00:04:34,854 --> 00:04:39,192
Mr. Nam Sang-ho,
deputy for urban development policy.

75
00:04:39,654 --> 00:04:40,887
He's in charge of redevelopment,
so greet him.

76
00:04:41,587 --> 00:04:43,153
Once again,
we sincerely thank you.

77
00:04:43,154 --> 00:04:45,219
We have high expectations
for your company.

78
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:49,253
- I really respect this person...
- Better be worth the trouble

79
00:04:49,254 --> 00:04:50,853
- for bringing in a foreign company.
- This is someone I truly respect.

80
00:04:50,854 --> 00:04:52,053
Rep. Yong Su-cheol is here with us.

81
00:04:52,054 --> 00:04:54,219
Please give a round of applause.

82
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,086
If you support me,

83
00:04:56,087 --> 00:04:57,486
I'll challenge for a fifth term!

84
00:04:57,487 --> 00:04:59,119
Please give a round of applause!

85
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,954
We wish
for this city's success.

86
00:05:02,087 --> 00:05:03,020
Sure.

87
00:05:03,774 --> 00:05:05,077
Let's make it win-win for us both.

88
00:05:05,547 --> 00:05:06,480
Yes.

89
00:05:07,487 --> 00:05:10,186
Okay, everyone, are you ready?

90
00:05:10,187 --> 00:05:13,353
We will now take the first step for
the redevelopment of Sejeong-ro Block 4.

91
00:05:13,354 --> 00:05:15,687
The demolition of Changshin Building
will now begin.

92
00:05:16,087 --> 00:05:18,586
It's a historic moment
for the region's new leap to the future.

93
00:05:18,587 --> 00:05:21,220
Please give a warm round of applause
and cheers.

94
00:05:24,954 --> 00:05:26,954
Please get up from your seats.

95
00:05:27,454 --> 00:05:29,154
Now, turn around.

96
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,786
Raise your right hand high.

97
00:05:31,787 --> 00:05:35,919
At the count of three,
we will proceed with the blast ceremony.

98
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,953
All together.

99
00:05:36,954 --> 00:05:38,120
Three!

100
00:05:38,987 --> 00:05:39,754
Help me!

101
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,754
Is anyone out there?

102
00:05:41,755 --> 00:05:42,842
Two!

103
00:05:43,787 --> 00:05:45,086
Please!

104
00:05:45,087 --> 00:05:47,087
Help me!

105
00:05:47,254 --> 00:05:48,854
- One!
- Blast off!

106
00:05:56,820 --> 00:05:59,087
Cheers and applause!

107
00:06:03,054 --> 00:06:05,753
Wow, it's turned to ashes.

108
00:06:05,754 --> 00:06:08,353
I promise that a brighter future

109
00:06:08,354 --> 00:06:10,119
will be built on this ash.

110
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:13,320
You are all now rich!

111
00:06:19,587 --> 00:06:20,854
MAD CONCRETE DREAMS

112
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,820
EPISODE 1

113
00:06:44,657 --> 00:06:46,354
Eating like it's your birthday.

114
00:06:48,887 --> 00:06:49,919
It's so delicious.

115
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:53,220
Why make it complicated?
I said I'd prepare it. It's your birthday.

116
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,353
I've been hearing the same thing
for 20 years.

117
00:06:56,354 --> 00:06:57,287
Aren't you going to eat?

118
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:59,753
I hate seaweed soup.

119
00:06:59,754 --> 00:07:01,999
I only made it because
you and Da-rae like it.

120
00:07:04,887 --> 00:07:06,003
Oh.

121
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:08,284
I heard the bank interest rates
went up again.

122
00:07:08,587 --> 00:07:09,387
What?

123
00:07:09,554 --> 00:07:10,619
The interest.

124
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:11,754
Can you handle that?

125
00:07:12,887 --> 00:07:14,969
Don't worry about it.
I'll take care of everything.

126
00:07:15,654 --> 00:07:16,520
What about the vacancy?

127
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:19,019
A few people came
and checked it out yesterday.

128
00:07:19,020 --> 00:07:19,820
It's fine.

129
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:23,186
How long has it been since we listed it?

130
00:07:23,187 --> 00:07:24,387
Isn't it taking too long?

131
00:07:24,787 --> 00:07:26,586
I'll take care of everything.

132
00:07:26,587 --> 00:07:28,920
You just focus on Da-rae, okay?

133
00:07:29,773 --> 00:07:31,258
You always say that.

134
00:07:31,719 --> 00:07:34,019
Now that Da-rae's entrance exam
is almost done,

135
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:36,179
let's discuss things as we go.

136
00:07:36,687 --> 00:07:37,254
Sure.

137
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,687
METAL MECHANIC MR. KIM

138
00:07:47,554 --> 00:07:50,486
Oh, are you awake? Time to eat.

139
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,386
Why not?

140
00:07:52,387 --> 00:07:54,518
You should eat rice with seaweed soup.
It's delicious.

141
00:08:05,954 --> 00:08:09,787
Did you send
the file for the entrance exam briefing?

142
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:11,620
I'm working on it now.

143
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:13,620
I'll finish it by tomorrow.

144
00:08:14,287 --> 00:08:16,286
Oh, that was delicious.

145
00:08:16,287 --> 00:08:17,387
Honey, I'm heading out.

146
00:08:21,154 --> 00:08:22,520
Where are you going?

147
00:08:23,554 --> 00:08:24,653
To the building.

148
00:08:24,654 --> 00:08:25,654
Dad is off to work.

149
00:08:26,020 --> 00:08:30,120
Then I'll see you
at Mom's birthday party later?

150
00:08:31,221 --> 00:08:32,121
Of course.

151
00:08:32,754 --> 00:08:36,320
I'm going to stop by my friend's place
for a study group.

152
00:08:37,554 --> 00:08:40,554
The birthday cake that we reserved.

153
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:45,920
Don't forget to bring it.

154
00:08:46,728 --> 00:08:47,628
Okay.

155
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:52,387
Did you prepare the gift?

156
00:08:52,954 --> 00:08:54,153
Of course.

157
00:08:54,154 --> 00:08:55,387
What do you take me for?

158
00:08:55,654 --> 00:08:56,986
Da-rae, come here.

159
00:08:56,987 --> 00:08:58,620
Oh, my baby.

160
00:08:59,420 --> 00:09:00,720
Eat up. The seaweed soup is good.

161
00:09:01,354 --> 00:09:02,420
Honey, I'm leaving.

162
00:09:31,687 --> 00:09:34,054
We cannot be chased away!
We completely oppose redevelopment!

163
00:09:50,587 --> 00:09:54,554
SEYOON BUILDING

164
00:10:04,254 --> 00:10:06,520
GO SALON

165
00:10:08,687 --> 00:10:09,920
Oh, seriously.

166
00:10:12,321 --> 00:10:15,221
Anyway, the owner has no sense.

167
00:10:16,454 --> 00:10:18,220
NO SMOKING BUILDING

168
00:10:22,354 --> 00:10:23,620
I mean, excuse me.

169
00:10:25,154 --> 00:10:27,153
This is a non-smoking building.

170
00:10:27,154 --> 00:10:28,553
Why are people smoking?

171
00:10:28,554 --> 00:10:29,653
I'll have an iced latte.

172
00:10:29,654 --> 00:10:30,687
With the landlord discount.

173
00:10:31,476 --> 00:10:33,224
The boss said no

174
00:10:33,687 --> 00:10:35,186
and to take back
the previous discounts.

175
00:10:35,187 --> 00:10:36,319
I got scolded a lot.

176
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,854
Oh, really?

177
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:40,053
I'll talk to him again.

178
00:10:40,054 --> 00:10:41,792
But for now, can I get an iced latte?

179
00:10:41,793 --> 00:10:42,853
By the way,

180
00:10:42,854 --> 00:10:44,453
the boss was looking for you.

181
00:10:44,454 --> 00:10:46,149
He said the restroom
needs to be fixed again.

182
00:10:47,087 --> 00:10:47,987
Okay.

183
00:10:49,087 --> 00:10:50,087
But...

184
00:10:50,587 --> 00:10:52,787
I'll be back in five minutes.
Have my iced latte ready.

185
00:11:06,654 --> 00:11:08,354
MANAGEMENT OFFICE

186
00:11:26,487 --> 00:11:27,687
KOREA ELECTRIC POWER CORPORATION

187
00:11:29,854 --> 00:11:31,587
NARI BANK

188
00:11:41,054 --> 00:11:43,519
Loan amount: 1 billion /
Interest: 4,818,180 won

189
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:47,387
BILL AMOUNT: INTEREST OF 4,818,180 WON

190
00:11:47,754 --> 00:11:49,653
IF PAID ON TIME: 4,818,180 WON

191
00:11:49,654 --> 00:11:53,687
To: Gi Su-jong
Payment reminder notice - Certified

192
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,587
GI SU-JONG / ACCOUNT: -128,666 WON

193
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:08,887
Today's the direct
trade for the Chamer card wallet, right?

194
00:12:09,354 --> 00:12:10,820
Yes, it's 500,000 won, right?

195
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:37,619
- No. 3788.
- Okay.

196
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:38,520
Thanks.

197
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,587
- Dream Hills? Okay.
- Yes, that's right.

198
00:13:33,287 --> 00:13:34,287
Yes, thank you.

199
00:13:35,454 --> 00:13:36,920
Oh, pizza.

200
00:14:00,854 --> 00:14:02,987
Oh? Da-rae's dad?

201
00:14:04,987 --> 00:14:08,187
Oh...

202
00:14:08,454 --> 00:14:10,686
So you guys were here?

203
00:14:10,687 --> 00:14:13,219
- Isn't he the landlord?
- Were you all gathered here?

204
00:14:13,220 --> 00:14:15,220
But why is he delivering?

205
00:14:15,497 --> 00:14:16,786
Why chicken...

206
00:14:16,787 --> 00:14:18,620
Dad?
What brings you here?

207
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,219
Well,

208
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:24,819
Dad brought a gift
to surprise you, Da-rae.

209
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:26,920
I was the one who paid.

210
00:14:28,320 --> 00:14:29,287
How much was it?

211
00:14:30,887 --> 00:14:32,119
It was 100,000 won.

212
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,720
Yes, 100,000 won.

213
00:14:35,054 --> 00:14:36,353
Here's the 100,000 won.

214
00:14:36,354 --> 00:14:37,420
Here.

215
00:14:38,620 --> 00:14:40,786
I came to give it directly.

216
00:14:40,787 --> 00:14:41,653
Enjoy the food.

217
00:14:41,654 --> 00:14:43,353
Eat that while it's hot
since it's fried, okay?

218
00:14:43,354 --> 00:14:44,053
Go on in.

219
00:14:44,054 --> 00:14:45,619
- Thank you.
- Yes, take care.

220
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:46,153
- Thank you.
- Goodbye.

221
00:14:46,154 --> 00:14:47,420
Yes.

222
00:14:51,187 --> 00:14:53,720
Are you
back on your delivery job, Dad?

223
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,219
No, I'm not.

224
00:14:55,220 --> 00:14:57,631
I'm just here to surprise you.

225
00:14:57,921 --> 00:15:01,254
I'm a landlord. I don't do deliveries.

226
00:15:02,187 --> 00:15:04,054
I don't mind though.

227
00:15:06,154 --> 00:15:09,354
Anyway, did you get the cake?

228
00:15:12,087 --> 00:15:15,653
They're open until 6 PM.

229
00:15:15,654 --> 00:15:17,453
Should I go?

230
00:15:17,454 --> 00:15:19,320
I was planning to leave anyway.

231
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:21,686
No, it's okay.

232
00:15:21,687 --> 00:15:23,119
I'll go get it.

233
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:24,019
Da-rae, go back in.

234
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:25,820
I'll see you later. Go back in.

235
00:15:30,654 --> 00:15:33,220
Go in, Da-rae.
I'll see you later.

236
00:15:37,487 --> 00:15:38,754
Huh?

237
00:15:40,687 --> 00:15:42,286
I've arrived.

238
00:15:42,287 --> 00:15:43,687
Oh, good.

239
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:51,553
But sir,

240
00:15:51,554 --> 00:15:52,354
what about the box?

241
00:15:52,954 --> 00:15:55,230
I looked it up,
but there's no box.

242
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:59,108
But you said the box
and the parts are all there.

243
00:15:59,519 --> 00:16:01,135
Well, I guess that's how it is.

244
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:02,856
I'll take off 10,000 won.

245
00:16:03,181 --> 00:16:04,814
Take off 10,000 won?

246
00:16:05,287 --> 00:16:06,486
It's cheap.

247
00:16:06,487 --> 00:16:08,466
A luxury item for 500,000 won,
it's a steal.

248
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:11,253
But without the box, it means nothing.

249
00:16:11,254 --> 00:16:12,886
What if it's fake?

250
00:16:12,887 --> 00:16:13,853
Excuse me?

251
00:16:13,854 --> 00:16:16,319
You wanted a direct transaction,
even though I'm busy.

252
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,948
Are you saying you want to back out?

253
00:16:19,087 --> 00:16:22,386
Come on, no need to be sensitive.
I'm just saying.

254
00:16:22,387 --> 00:16:24,354
Then, let's just do this.

255
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:26,333
Take off 200,000 won. I don't have cash.

256
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:28,554
Jeez, what a difficult customer.

257
00:16:29,587 --> 00:16:30,519
I'll do 100,000 won.

258
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:31,287
Deal.

259
00:16:33,354 --> 00:16:34,275
Bye.

260
00:16:38,987 --> 00:16:40,153
Mr. Kim.

261
00:16:40,154 --> 00:16:41,852
You just need to sign here.

262
00:16:45,587 --> 00:16:46,186
Bond Transfer Agreement
From: Kim Yong-guk, To: Gi Su-jong

263
00:16:46,187 --> 00:16:46,819
Transfers the monetary claim to assignee
Real Capital and Global Partners

264
00:16:46,820 --> 00:16:47,954
Accordingly, this bond transfer agreement
will be executed

265
00:16:51,554 --> 00:16:52,741
I brought

266
00:16:53,694 --> 00:16:56,227
a gift for you.

267
00:16:58,094 --> 00:16:59,094
What's this?

268
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:00,654
Would you like to see?

269
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:11,073
Decide whether to stamp it

270
00:17:11,354 --> 00:17:12,837
or to put yours in here.

271
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:14,853
You have three seconds to decide.

272
00:17:14,854 --> 00:17:17,153
One, two, three!

273
00:17:17,154 --> 00:17:18,220
I'll stamp it.

274
